    """Every existing receipt, movement, in-stock unit and issue was at the
    one place stock was before locations existed: the default site. If no
    default has been chosen, the first active warehouse becomes it; if there
    are no sites at all, a "Main warehouse" is created so the stock already
    on the shelf has somewhere to be (rename it under Stock -> Sites)."""
